hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah pehre dene wale pehredaron par rehem farmaye.'"
"2","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte hue suna: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah pehre dene wale pehredaron par rehem farmaye.'"
